  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Yi Tian Mountain, after endless fist shadows already throw Purple Mountain True Monarch around, Duke Long activates the immortal killer move chaotic dragon fist. He expects a hit to make the enemy’s thoughts chaotic so they cannot think and only take punches, yet that effect does not appear on Purple Mountain True Monarch. At Duke Long’s level the transformation path killer move carries wisdom path effects, but against a wisdom path Gu Immortal it is child’s play; he can punch other enemies to death with it and still only holds the upper hand here.",
      "chapters": [
        1363
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_yi_tian_mountain",
        "char_purple_mountain_true_monarch",
        "char_duke_long",
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "path_wisdom",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He later recalls using teleportation to close in and chaotic dragon fist to suppress Purple Mountain True Monarch in that fight.",
      "chapters": [
        1367
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Together with dragon claw strike, fist shadows and claw marks wreck Seven Extreme Desolation’s head again and again while leaving Calamity Luck Altar in ruins.",
      "chapters": [
        1733
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-court-invasion",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_seven_extreme_desolation",
        "house_calamity_luck_altar"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Against Fang Yuan’s immemorial sword dragon, Duke Long’s chaotic dragon fist can disturb thoughts and cause killer moves to fail when activating. In Duke Long’s transformation path combat system, dragon claw strike, chaotic dragon fist, spiraling dragon fangs, and world shaking dragon hammer handle offense across close, mid-range, and long range.",
